    {
      "id": 13,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "p99 per dependency — where the send latency actually goes",
      "description": "The panel step 47 needs to ATTRIBUTE a p99 breach instead of merely reporting it. Two queries, because there are two kinds of dependency: the HTTP ones (ledger, fraud, accounts, the BACEN rail) come from Micrometer's http.client.requests, and the infrastructure ones (DynamoDB, Redis) from pix.dependency.seconds — the AWS SDK metric publisher and the renamed Lettuce recorder, both shipped by common-lib so every service measures the same way.\n\nDeliberately NOT derived from spans. The collector's spanmetrics connector would have covered all six for free, but this platform samples traces with a deliberate bias toward failures (ADR-0021 decision 5), so a p99 computed from sampled spans is skewed high by construction — and the panel would go dark whenever the trace pipeline did. Metrics see every call; traces explain the interesting ones.\n\nSQS ReceiveMessage is excluded on purpose. A long poll BLOCKS for up to its waitTimeSeconds by design, so it reports a p99 of ~20s — the consumer working correctly, and the single largest number on the panel. Leaving it in would make the one series that is never a problem dominate the one panel whose job is to find the series that is.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "platinumcoin-prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 16,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 25
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "mappings": [],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "s",
          "decimals": 3,
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 0,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": true,
            "axisLabel": ""
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "platinumcoin-prometheus"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.99, sum by (le, client_name) (rate(http_client_requests_seconds_bucket[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "{{client_name}} (http)",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false,
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "platinumcoin-prometheus"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.99, sum by (le, dependency) (rate(pix_dependency_seconds_bucket{operation!=\"ReceiveMessage\"}[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "{{dependency}}",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false,
          "refId": "B"
        }
      ]
    },
