    {
      "id": 15,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Send Pix — error-budget burn rate (KR2.1)",
      "description": "BURN RATE, not latency: how fast this SLO is spending its error budget, as a multiple of 'exactly on budget'. 1.0 means the SLO is being met precisely; 14.4 empties a 30-day budget in about two days. Computed as a division of two counters — the requests inside the SLO bucket over all requests — because step 44 registered a histogram boundary at exactly the SLO value so this would never be an interpolation.\n\nTwo windows because one cannot be both fast to fire and fast to STOP: the long window measures, the short one confirms the problem is still happening. The watchdog (settlement-service) fires only when both cross their line, which is why the alert goes quiet minutes after an incident does rather than when the hourly average forgets it. The objective is 99% of sends acknowledged inside 2s, so the budget is 1% of requests.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "platinumcoin-prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 33
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "mappings": [],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "none",
          "decimals": 3,
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 0,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": true,
            "axisLabel": ""
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byRegexp",
              "options": ".*(page|ticket).*"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "custom.lineStyle",
                "value": {
                  "dash": [
                    10,
                    10
                  ],
                  "fill": "dash"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "custom.fillOpacity",
                "value": 0
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "platinumcoin-prometheus"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "(1 - (sum(increase(http_server_requests_seconds_bucket{uri=\"/v1/payments/pix\",le=\"2.0\"}[1h])) / sum(increase(http_server_requests_seconds_count{uri=\"/v1/payments/pix\"}[1h])))) / 0.01",
          "legendFormat": "burn rate — 1h window",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false,
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "platinumcoin-prometheus"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "(1 - (sum(increase(http_server_requests_seconds_bucket{uri=\"/v1/payments/pix\",le=\"2.0\"}[5m])) / sum(increase(http_server_requests_seconds_count{uri=\"/v1/payments/pix\"}[5m])))) / 0.01",
          "legendFormat": "burn rate — 5m window",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false,
          "refId": "B"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "platinumcoin-prometheus"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "14.4",
          "legendFormat": "fast-burn page (14.4x)",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false,
          "refId": "C"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "platinumcoin-prometheus"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "6",
          "legendFormat": "slow-burn ticket (6x)",
